ePatchRect` covering its full public API surface:\r\n\r\n- Default property values (texture, patch margins, region rect, draw center, axis stretch modes, mouse filter, minimum size)\r\n- `set_texture` / `get_texture` round-trip, including clearing the texture\r\n- `texture_changed` signal emission: new texture, same texture (no re-emit), replacement, and clearing\r\n- `set_patch_margin` / `get_patch_margin` for all four sides independently and in isolation\r\n- Patch margins driving `get_combined_minimum_size()` (left + right, top + bottom)\r\n- Out-of-range `Side` index guarded by `ERR_FAIL_INDEX`\r\n- `region_rect` round-trip and `draw_center` toggling\r\n- All three `AxisStretchMode` values for both axes, and independence between the two axes\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote every line, and ran pre-commit and the test suite locally. Claude Sonnet 4.6 helped with initial research and drafting.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","